/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106210","id":2870725338,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6rG8ra","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-12T03:50:24Z","updated_at":"2025-05-12T03:50:24Z","body":"You have stumbled on something that is well known among graphics programmers and is a common stumbling block for new shader authors. Nvidia GPUs use a very low precision form of `sin` for performance reasons that make it totally unusable for hash functions like this which operate on very small and/or very large numbers. This issue is so notorious it has led to shadertoys like this: https://www.shadertoy.com/view/4djSRW which is a huge collection of hash functions that don't rely on `sin`. Note its over 10 years old and we are all still dealing with this issue. \n\nAlso see: https://github.com/danilw/GPU-my-list-of-bugs, and https://www.shadertoy.com/view/stK3WG, and https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/67150","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2870725338/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]